#: src/utils/branding.rs:13
msgid "Configurable and Customizable"
msgstr "Sozlash va Moslash mumkin"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:15
msgid ""
"Easily modify and manage your system configuration with the power of nix"
msgstr ""
"NixOS yordamida tizim sozlamalarini osongina o‘zgartiring va boshqaring"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:20
msgid "Nix Package Manager"
msgstr "Nix paket menejeri"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:22
msgid "Keep your system stable with Nix's reliable and reproducible packages"
msgstr ""
"Nix’ning ishonchli va takrorlanadigan paketlari bilan tizimingizni barqaror "
"saqlang"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:27
msgid "Over 140,000 packages available"
msgstr "140,000dan ortiq paketlar mavjud"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:29 src/utils/branding.rs:55
msgid "Easily find and install all the packages you need on your Xinux system"
msgstr "Xinux tizimida kerakli barcha paketlarni osongina toping va o‘rnating"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:34
msgid "E-Imzo Manager"
msgstr "E-IMZO menejer"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:35
msgid "A graphical E-Imzo keys manager for NixOS based distributions."
msgstr "NixOS asosidagi distributivlar uchun grafik E-Imzo kalitlar menejeri."

#: src/utils/branding.rs:39
msgid "Software Center"
msgstr "Dasturiy taminot"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:41
msgid "A graphical app store for Nix built with libadwaita, GTK4, and Relm4."
msgstr ""
"Libadwaita, GTK4 va Relm4 yordamida yaratilgan, nix uchun moʻljallangan "
"grafik ilovalar doʻkoni."

#: src/utils/branding.rs:46
msgid "Module Manager"
msgstr "Modul menager"

#: src/utils/branding.rs:48
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to provide a simple graphical tool for modifying "
"and managing desktop Xinux configurations."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu loyihaning maqsadi — ish stolida Xinux konfiguratsiyalarini "
"o‘zgartirish va boshqarish uchun qulay grafik ilovalar taqdim etish."

#: src/utils/branding.rs:53
msgid "Uzbek Keyboard Layout"
msgstr "Oʻzbek klaviatura maketi"

#: src/utils/flow.rs:61
msgid "Extra Options"
msgstr "Qo‘shimcha parametrlar"

#: src/utils/flow.rs:65
msgid "Flatpak"
